#| msgid ""
#| "checks for an alphabetic character; in the standard B<\"C\"> locale, it "
#| "is equivalent to B<(isupper(>I<c>B<) || islower(>I<c>B<))>.  In some "
#| "locales, there may be additional characters for which B<isalpha()> is "
